---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const assetBoundaryId = 'assets-boundary';
---
<Layout title="Anleggsmidler" activeNav="assets"><p id={assetBoundaryId} class="page-boundary" role="status">Kontrollerer innlogging…</p><main class="a-shell"><section class="a-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Styr.ing · anleggsmidler</span><h1>To avskrivningsspor.<br /><em>Én forklaring.</em></h1><p>Følg anskaffelseskost, bokført verdi og forskjellen mellom regnskapsmessig og skattemessig avskrivning uten å miste kontrollsporet.</p><a href="#a-work" class="primary">Åpne anleggsregisteret ↓</a></div><div class="a-orb"><strong id="hero-assets">—</strong><span>aktive eiendeler</span><small id="hero-review">— til kontroll</small></div></section><section class="metrics"><article><span>Anskaffelseskost</span><strong id="m-cost">—</strong><small>aktive eiendeler</small></article><article><span>Avskrevet</span><strong id="m-dep">—</strong><small>regnskapsmessig hittil</small></article><article><span>Til gjennomgang</span><strong id="m-review">—</strong><small>før bokføring</small></article><article class="dark"><span>Bokføring</span><strong>KONTROLLERT</strong><small>godkjennes og bokføres separat</small></article></section><section id="a-work" class="workspace"><div class="head"><div><span class="kicker">To avskrivningsspor</span><h2>Anleggsmidler og avskrivning</h2></div><span id="status">Henter…</span></div><nav class="tabs">{[['assets','Eiendeler'],['depreciation','Avskrivninger']].map(([key,label],i)=><button class={i===0?'active':''} data-view={key}>{label}</button>)}</nav><div id="list"></div></section><section class="asset-actions"><div><span class="kicker">Kontrollert register</span><h2>Legg til og beregn — før bokføring.</h2><p>Opprett eiendelen, velg metode og skattegruppe, og generer begge avskrivningsspor for kontroll.</p></div><div class="asset-action-grid"><form id="create-asset-form"><strong>Ny eiendel</strong><label>Nummer<input name="assetNumber" maxlength="80" required placeholder="AM-2026-003" /></label><label>Navn<input name="name" maxlength="200" required placeholder="Maskin eller inventar" /></label><div class="form-row"><label>Kategori<input name="category" required placeholder="Inventar" /></label><label>Kjøpsdato<input name="acquisitionDate" type="date" required /></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Kost i kroner<input name="cost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required /></label><label>Restverdi<input name="residual" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" required /></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Levetid (måneder)<input name="life" type="number" min="1" max="1200" required placeholder="60" /></label><label>Skattegruppe<input name="taxGroup" maxlength="10" placeholder="d" /></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Metode<select name="method"><option value="linear">Lineær</option><option value="declining_balance">Saldo</option><option value="none">Ingen</option></select></label><label>Skattesats %<input name="taxRate" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" value="20" /></label></div><button type="submit">Opprett eiendel</button><small>Registrerer kun grunnlaget. Ingen bilag bokføres.</small></form><form id="calculate-depreciation-form"><strong>Beregn periode</strong><label>Eiendel<select name="assetId" id="asset-select" required></select></label><label>Periode<input name="period" pattern="\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])" required placeholder="2026-09" /></label><button type="submit">Beregn begge spor</button><small>Regnskap og skatt blir separate kontrollposter.</small></form><form id="depreciation-approval-form"><strong>Godkjenn beregning</strong><label>Avskrivningspost<select name="entryId" id="depreciation-select" required></select></label><button type="submit">Godkjenn beregning</button><small>Bokføringsbilag opprettes ikke automatisk.</small></form></div><p id="asset-action-status" class="action-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section><section class="notice"><strong>Kontrollert bokføring</strong><p>Beregningene er et internt kontrollgrunnlag. Skatteklasse, levetid og restverdi må kvalitetssikres. Godkjente regnskapsavskrivninger kan deretter bokføres med kontrollert bilag i <a href="/app/finance/">regnskapsflaten</a>; skattepostene holdes i eget spor.</p></section></main></Layout>
<script is:inline>
const esc=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>'"]/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;',"'":'&#39;','"':'&quot;'}[c])); const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search); let assetBoardId=params.get('boardId')||''; const boundary=document.getElementById('assets-boundary'), forms=[...document.querySelectorAll('.asset-actions form')]; forms.forEach(form=>{form.setAttribute('aria-disabled','true');form.querySelectorAll('input,select,textarea,button').forEach(control=>{control.disabled=true;});});
const list=document.getElementById('list'),status=document.getElementById('status'),actionStatus=document.getElementById('asset-action-status');
const labels={active:'Aktiv',financial:'Regnskap',tax:'Skatt',calculated:'Beregnet',review:'Til kontroll',approved:'Godkjent'}; const pill=v=>`<em class="pill">${esc(labels[v]||v||'—')}</em>`; const money=n=>`${new Intl.NumberFormat('nb-NO').format(Number(n||0)/100)} NOK`;
const api=async(path,opt)=>{const r=await fetch(path,opt),d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error||'request_failed');return d};
const render=(view,rows)=>{const f={assets:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.asset_number)} · ${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${esc(r.category)} · Anskaffet ${esc(r.acquisition_date)} · Skattegruppe ${esc(r.tax_group||'—')}</p></div>${pill(r.status)}<b>${money(r.acquisition_cost_minor)}</b></article>`,depreciation:r=>`<article><div><strong>${esc(r.period)} · ${esc(r.asset_number)} · ${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>Bokført verdi ${money(r.book_value_minor)} · Akkumulert ${money(r.accumulated_minor)}</p></div>${pill(r.ledger_type)}${pill(r.status)}<b>${money(r.amount_minor)}</b></article>`};list.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(f[view]).join(''):'<p class="empty">Ingen registrerte rader.</p>';};
const resolveAssetBoard=async()=>{try{const a=await(await fetch('/api/auth')).json();const requested=params.get('boardId');const selected=a.authenticated?(a.boards||[]).find(x=>x.id===requested)||(a.boards||[])[0]:null;if(selected){assetBoardId=selected.id;boundary.textContent=`Virksomhet: ${selected.name||'valgt virksomhet'} · kontrollert arbeidsflate`;forms.forEach(form=>{form.removeAttribute('aria-disabled');form.querySelectorAll('input,select,textarea,button').forEach(control=>{control.disabled=false;});});return assetBoardId;}}catch{}boundary.innerHTML='Dette er en lesedemo med fiktive data. <a href="/login?next=%2Fassets">Logg inn for å registrere eiendeler.</a>';return assetBoardId='board-1'};const fillOptions=async()=>{await resolveAssetBoard();const [assets,depreciation]=await Promise.all([api(`/api/assets?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(assetBoardId)}&view=assets`),api(`/api/assets?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(assetBoardId)}&view=depreciation`)]);document.getElementById('asset-select').innerHTML=(assets.data||[]).filter(r=>r.status==='active').map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.asset_number)} · ${esc(r.name)}</option>`).join('')||'<option value="">Ingen aktive eiendeler</option>';document.getElementById('depreciation-select').innerHTML=(depreciation.data||[]).filter(r=>['calculated','review'].includes(r.status)).map(r=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.period)} · ${esc(r.asset_number)} · ${money(r.amount_minor)}</option>`).join('')||'<option value="">Ingen poster til kontroll</option>';};
const load=async view=>{try{await resolveAssetBoard();const d=await api(`/api/assets?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(assetBoardId)}&view=${view}`);render(view,d.data||[]);status.textContent=`${(d.data||[]).length} poster · kilde synlig`;}catch{status.textContent='API utilgjengelig'}}; const summary=async()=>{try{await resolveAssetBoard();const d=(await api(`/api/assets?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(assetBoardId)}&view=summary`)).data||{};document.getElementById('hero-assets').textContent=d.assets?.count??0;document.getElementById('hero-review').textContent=`${d.review?.count??0} til kontroll`;document.getElementById('m-cost').textContent=money(d.cost?.amount_minor);document.getElementById('m-dep').textContent=money(d.depreciation?.amount_minor);document.getElementById('m-review').textContent=d.review?.count??0;}catch{}};
const post=async payload=>{await resolveAssetBoard();await api('/api/assets',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({boardId:assetBoardId,...payload})});actionStatus.textContent='Endringen er lagret og auditert.';actionStatus.classList.remove('error');await Promise.all([summary(),fillOptions(),load(document.querySelector('.tabs button.active')?.dataset.view||'assets')]);}; const errorMessage=err=>{actionStatus.textContent=err.message==='write_not_authorized'?'Du trenger eier- eller redaktørrolle.':'Handlingen kunne ikke lagres.';actionStatus.classList.add('error');};
document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');load(b.dataset.view)}));
document.getElementById('create-asset-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'create_asset',assetNumber:f.get('assetNumber'),name:f.get('name'),category:f.get('category'),acquisitionDate:f.get('acquisitionDate'),acquisitionCostMinor:Math.round(Number(f.get('cost'))*100),residualValueMinor:Math.round(Number(f.get('residual'))*100),usefulLifeMonths:Number(f.get('life')),taxGroup:f.get('taxGroup'),financialMethod:f.get('method'),taxRatePercent:Number(f.get('taxRate'))});e.currentTarget.reset()}catch(err){errorMessage(err)}});
document.getElementById('calculate-depreciation-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'calculate_depreciation',assetId:f.get('assetId'),period:f.get('period')});}catch(err){errorMessage(err)}});
document.getElementById('depreciation-approval-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);try{await post({action:'approve_depreciation',entryId:f.get('entryId')});}catch(err){errorMessage(err)}});summary();fillOptions();load('assets');
</script>
<style>.a-shell{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:38px 24px 80px}.a-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .45fr;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:44px;border-radius:27px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#3d3422,#84703c);color:#fff}.eyebrow,.kicker{font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f4e5b2}.a-hero h1{margin:20px 0 16px;font:500 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.4rem)/.96 Georgia,serif}.a-hero h1 em{color:#f4df94;font-style:normal}.a-hero p{max-width:570px;color:#ffffffbf;font:1rem/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}.primary{display:inline-flex;margin-top:22px;padding:13px 17px;border-radius:10px;background:#f4df94;color:#3e3523;font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.a-orb{width:190px;height:190px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #f4e5b2aa;border-radius:50%;background:#66572e;color:#fff}.a-orb strong{font:500 3.2rem Georgia,serif;color:#f9e9ad}.a-orb span,.a-orb small{font:.68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.a-orb small{margin-top:9px;color:#e7d9a8}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:16px 0 52px}.metrics article{min-height:105px;padding:17px;border:1px solid #10241f14;border-radius:15px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.metrics .dark{background:#10241f;color:#fff}.metrics span,.metrics small{color:#718078;font:600 .67rem system-ui,sans-serif}.metrics strong{font:500 1.55rem Georgia,serif}.workspace{padding:28px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.head h2{margin:9px 0 0;font:500 2.1rem Georgia,serif}.head>span{color:#718078;font:.7rem system-ui,sans-serif}.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:25px 0 12px}.tabs button{padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #10241f1c;border-radius:9px;background:#fafbf9;color:#65746b;cursor:pointer;font:700 .72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.tabs button.active{background:#84703c;color:#fff}.workspace article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr auto auto auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:15px 4px;border-top:1px solid #10241f12}.workspace strong{font:600 .82rem system-ui,sans-serif}.workspace p{margin:5px 0 0;color:#718078;font:.7rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.pill{padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#f6eed5;color:#766334;font:700 .61rem system-ui,sans-serif;font-style:normal;white-space:nowrap}.asset-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:25px;margin-top:32px;padding:28px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:20px;background:#f8f4e8}.asset-actions h2{margin:10px 0 8px;font:500 1.8rem/1.05 Georgia,serif}.asset-actions p{color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-action-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}.asset-action-grid form{display:grid;gap:9px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #10241f14;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.asset-action-grid label{display:grid;gap:5px;color:#63736a;font:600 .64rem system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-action-grid input,.asset-action-grid select{width:100%;padding:9px;border:1px solid #10241f1c;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;font:.72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-action-grid button{padding:9px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#84703c;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-action-grid small{color:#718078;font:.62rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:1.2em;margin:0;color:#286447;font:700 .68rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status.error{color:#97443d}.notice{margin-top:35px;padding:22px 25px;border-radius:16px;background:#f7f1df}.notice strong{font:700 .78rem system-ui,sans-serif}.notice p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}@media(max-width:800px){.a-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.asset-actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.a-shell{padding:20px 15px 55px}.a-hero{padding:28px 22px}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workspace{padding:20px 16px}.workspace article{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.workspace article b{grid-column:1}.asset-action-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.asset-actions{padding:20px 16px}}
.asset-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:25px;margin-top:32px;padding:28px;border:1px solid #10241f18;border-radius:20px;background:#f8f4e8}.asset-actions h2{margin:10px 0 8px;font:500 1.8rem/1.05 Georgia,serif}.asset-actions p{color:#63736a;font:.78rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-actions form{display:grid;gap:9px;padding:16px;border:1px solid #10241f14;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.asset-actions label{display:grid;gap:5px;color:#63736a;font:600 .64rem system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-actions select{width:100%;padding:9px;border:1px solid #10241f1c;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;font:.72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-actions button{padding:9px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#84703c;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:700 .68rem system-ui,sans-serif}.asset-actions small{color:#718078;font:.62rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:1.2em;margin:0;color:#286447;font:700 .68rem/1.35 system-ui,sans-serif}.action-status.error{color:#97443d}@media(max-width:800px){.asset-actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.asset-actions{padding:20px 16px}}
</style>
